## Search requires at least 3 characters

### When I type <search> in the search the button is <status>

@feat:22089

- **Given** I am a user on the home page
- **When** I search "<search>"
- **Then** the "Search" button is <status>

**Examples**

| search | status |
| --- | --- |
|  | disabled |
| a | disabled |
| ab | disabled |
| abc | enabled |
| azeazeaze | enabled |

## When I have no results, the message "No results found..." tells me so

### Search by dealer name with no results

@feat:21726

- **Given** I am a user on the home page
- **When** I search "test"
- **Then** the error message "No results found for the search performed" appears

## When the search returns an error, the message "No results found..." tells me so

### Search by dealer name with error

- **Given** I am a user on the home page and the search returns an error
- **When** I search "test"
- **Then** the error message "No results found for the search performed" appears
